sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — MorphoEval overall 91.2/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py` (91.3/100, up from 59.6/100 in Pass 1; +31.7 overall). The remediated script derives the exact Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) with lower and upper saddle-node bifurcations M_1 = 1.0254 nM and M_2 = 3.3038 nM (hysteresis window Delta_M = 2.2784 nM vs 0.0 nM in the CYP26-null monostable control), solves the 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE system along the 1000 um chick PSM (positioning the determination front at x_front = 571.46 um with a 10-90% jump width Delta_x_front = 16.24 um, a 22.2-fold sharpening over the shallow exponential fgf8 mRNA decay length lambda_M = 360.67 um), reproduces all 5 experimental perturbation regimes (Wild-Type S_0 = 150.0 um, Vitamin A Deficiency VAD S_VAD = 105.0 um vs observed 106.0 um, Exogenous RA S_RA = 195.0 um vs observed 194.0 um satisfying S_VAD + S_RA = 300.0 um = 2*S_0, SU5402 FGFR1 block S = 215.0 um, and ectopic FGF8 bead S = 97.5 um; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.84 um), and segments the vendored chick/vertebrate SEM specimen (`chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg`, 8 upper and 9 lower somites, mean spacing 48.47 px), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean`. Overall 91.2/100 (faithfulness 91.0, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1336827 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde (sha256 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde), spec_fingerprint 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601; artifact_sha256: 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_reference.json=42c6196ddd32cee9..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/scout_manifest.json=783faa9ee6b3db0c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Cell / Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 mutual cross-inhibition + CYP26A1 RA-degradation PDEs producing an S-shaped hysteresis curve [M_1, M_2] and an all-or-none determination front switch | Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) J. Theor. Biol. 239:413-429 & Diez del Corral et al. (2003) Neuron 40:65-79 opposing Vitamin A Deficiency (VAD) anterior front shift vs exogenous RA / SU5402 posterior front shift; reconstructed_in_script: Analytical inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) solver extracting lower saddle-node M_1 = 1.0254 nM and upper saddle-node M_2 = 3.3038 nM (Delta_M = 2.2784 nM) | 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE solver along the 1000 um chick PSM demonstrating 22.2x sharpening of the determination front (Delta_x_front = 16.24 um vs lambda_M = 360.67 um) at x_front = 571.46 um | 5-regime somite perturbation evaluator (WT, VAD, exogenous RA, SU5402, ectopic FGF8 bead; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.84 um) plus bilateral dorsal somite row segmentation on chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing); transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior chick presomitic mesoderm axis mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite rows; does_not_claim: Full 3D mesenchymal-to-epithelial somite rosette mechanics or explicit intracellular Her1/Hes7 delayed transcriptional clock ODEs." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 1D Goldbeter-Pourquie RA-FGF8/Wnt bistable switch directly to a delayed Her1/Hes7 or Notch-Delta phase oscillator lattice to model saltatory somite arrest.",
            "remediation needed: Extend the 1D PSM axis to 2D bilateral paraxial mesoderm strips to model left-right asymmetric somite defects under Raldh2/VAD perturbation (Vermot & Pourquie 2005)." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.912"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

